<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">HOFSTRA UNIVERSITY MUSEUM OF ART</h1>
  </header>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; height: calc(100% - 100px);">
    <div style="flex: 1; padding-right: 40px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 36pt; color: #001f3f; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">EDUCATIONAL PROGRAMS AND ACTIVITIES</h2>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;">
        <!-- Placeholder for Museum Logo -->
        <div style="width: 150px; height: auto; background-color: #001f3f; border: 2px solid #001f3f; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 12pt;">
          MUSEUM LOGO
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Engage Beyond the Frame</p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <!-- Image Placeholder -->
      <div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; background-color: #ccc; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #555;">
        IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">ABOUT THE MUSEUM</h2>
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <div style="width: 150px; height: 150px; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
        IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        Founded in {{ founding_year }}, the <span data-field="museum.name">{{ museum.name }}</span> has a permanent collection of more than {{ collection_size }} works from around the world in varied media dating from the ancient to the contemporary. The Museum embraces the value of art in sparking new insights, broadening perspectives, and helping build a more responsive community.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <!-- Image Placeholder -->
      <div style="width: 100%; height: 250px; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
        IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <div style="width: 150px; height: 150px; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
        IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        <span data-field="artwork_description">{{ artwork_description }}</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <!-- Image Placeholder -->
      <div style="width: 100%; height: 250px; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
        IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Pre-K - Grade 12 Programs</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        The Museum offers a variety of programs that engage students in the powerful experience of careful looking at, thinking about, and discussing art from around the world. These programs connect to multiple disciplines and expand students' learning in a collaborative, inquiry-based environment. Schools may choose to participate in a single visit or an in-depth partnership that comprises numerous sessions.
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <!-- Image Placeholder -->
        <div style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
          IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Undergraduate and Graduate Class Sessions</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        The Museum's rich resources afford unique and varied opportunities for customized sessions across all disciplines. Holding a class in our galleries led by Museum educators supports student-driven learning that engages participants in critical and creative thinking, collaboration, and dialogue.
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <!-- Image Placeholder -->
        <div style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
          IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Family Programs</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        Look, listen, and create together! We invite families to Museum programs that offer opportunities to spend time together, including <span data-field="program_examples">{{ program_examples }}</span>.
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <!-- Image Placeholder -->
        <div style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
          IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Community Group Visits*</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        We welcome visitors from communities both near and far of all ages. Museum educators are available to lead tours of our galleries and sculpture garden that can include art-making activities.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 15px;">*All group visits and the <span data-field="program_name">{{ program_name }}</span> family program require a reservation.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <!-- Image Placeholder -->
        <div style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
          IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Professional Development Programs</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        As a state-approved provider of Continuing Teacher and Leader Education (CTLE) hours, the Museum offers professional learning opportunities specifically designed to meet the needs of schools, faculty, and students. Discover how to use works of art to enhance teaching in all disciplines for all ages.
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <!-- Image Placeholder -->
        <div style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
          IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <!-- Image Placeholder -->
      <div style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
        IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Contact Us</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        For more information about the Museum and its family and educational programs, please visit <a href="#" style="color: #001f3f;">{{ website_url }}</a> or contact us at <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span> or <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;">
        <span data-field="museum_name">{{ museum_name }}</span> exhibitions and programs are made possible with funding from the government, private foundations, corporations, and the local community. Please check the museum website for current sponsors.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 0 0 200px; text-align: right;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">FOLLOW US ON</h3>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px;">
        <!-- Social Media Icons Placeholder -->
        <div style="width: 30px; height: 30px; background-color: #ccc;">F</div>
        <div style="width: 30px; height: 30px; background-color: #ccc;">I</div>
        <div style="width: 30px; height: 30px; background-color: #ccc;">T</div>
        <div style="width: 30px; height: 30px; background-color: #ccc;">L</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">HOFSTRA UNIVERSITY.</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0;">
        <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="street_address">{{ street_address }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="city_state_zip">{{ city_state_zip }}</span>
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 10px;">
        <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span><br>
        Office Hours: {{ office_hours }}
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 0 0 200px; text-align: right;">
      <!-- Logo Placeholder -->
      <div style="width: 100px; height: auto; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
        LOGO
      </div>
      <!-- Seal Placeholder -->
      <div style="width: 100px; height: auto; background-color: #eee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
